This photo shows the leftovers of a meal. There is an empty muffin liner with a few crumbs and blueberry residue, two nearly empty plates with a few crumbs, an empty butter or jam cup, and a glass with a little water.

Very little food remains: some crumbs, a bit of muffin stuck to the liner, and a small amount of residue in the cup. I estimate about 5 g of food in total. At roughly 4 kcal per gram for muffin crumbs, that comes to about 20 kcal.

